{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": [
    "Curated for asynchronous play: every word must be guessable from a silent",
    "replay with no gestures, no talking, and no back-and-forth. Abstract nouns",
    "(feeling, freedom, patience), verbs needing mime, and proper nouns are all",
    "excluded on purpose.",
    "",
    "easy   = one object, readable silhouette, a child could draw it",
    "medium = one object needing detail or context to be unambiguous",
    "hard   = a scene or composite idea; you have to compose something",
    "",
    "A dealt card offers one word from each tier. Higher tier, more points."
  ],

